    "long_instructions": "##Ride Share Site from the Future\r\n\r\nYou will be working with AI to create a ride sharing page that might exist 50 years in the future! Use the AI Chat to get suggestions about what you could add into your design.\r\n\r\nChoose three suggestions that you like, write them down, and move onto the next level to create your site.",
